      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Add seasoned tempeh to the skillet. Cook over medium-low heat, stirring often, until tempeh absorbs flavors, about 15 minutes. Reduce heat to low and keep warm until ready to serve.",
